WEBVTT

00:11:59.704 --> 00:12:02.385
in a power generation plant, I'm not just optimistic,

00:12:02.385 --> 00:12:03.993
I'm enthusiastic.

00:12:03.993 --> 00:12:07.447
This new technological revolution is upon us.

00:12:07.447 --> 00:12:10.641
So think about the future —
it will be here soon enough.

00:12:10.641 --> 00:12:13.326
Thank you.

00:12:13.326 --> 00:12:17.419
(Applause)